WEBVTT

00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:09.250
Up ahead?

00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:11.230
Yes, I'm positive.

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:15.490
However, I'm going to go
back to the Land of Guidance.

00:00:15.490 --> 00:00:15.950
Huh?!

00:00:16.370 --> 00:00:18.910
The attack yesterday destroyed
my weapon inventory.

00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:21.330
How could I go empty-handed?

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:23.920
The next time we meet will be in El Dorado.

00:00:35.550 --> 00:00:38.340
That's El Dorado...

00:02:36.960 --> 00:02:39.370
So they won't let us in that easily, huh?

00:03:05.030 --> 00:03:08.130
Oh! It's actually pretty clean inside?

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:10.080
It's decided then.

00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:13.920
A charm to keep people away.

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:20.250
We're going to stay here?

00:03:20.590 --> 00:03:21.260
Yeah.

00:03:21.630 --> 00:03:24.670
It's convenient to have
some kind of base of operations.

00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:26.710
Wow!

00:03:28.270 --> 00:03:29.180
Look!

00:03:30.270 --> 00:03:34.120
It's such a beautiful city. So shiny!

00:03:36.820 --> 00:03:38.730
My big brother is here somewhere...

00:03:47.200 --> 00:03:48.930
You know what to do, right?

00:03:49.370 --> 00:03:53.380
Find out who King is.
By order of the Watchdog Center, right?

00:03:54.290 --> 00:03:56.380
Well, I'm sure we'll figure it out!

00:03:56.750 --> 00:04:00.840
I wish Gina stayed with us. Besides...

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:11.220
Hmm?

00:04:17.110 --> 00:04:20.270
What's wrong? You look so serious.

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:24.490
It's bad for your body
to hold things in too much.

00:04:24.990 --> 00:04:27.120
You should go before you pee your pants.

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:28.530
Stupid!

00:04:29.280 --> 00:04:31.200
That's not it at all!

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:34.210
--Sword, what do you plan to do from here?
--This bag is pretty nice! I'll take it!

00:04:34.210 --> 00:04:35.150
It's a perfect fit!

00:04:35.540 --> 00:04:39.350
Luke, we're going to check out the city
and fancy ourselves up first!

00:04:45.930 --> 00:04:47.760
This thing is amazing.

00:04:49.430 --> 00:04:54.200
Hey, Handsome. Want to look upon my boobs?

00:04:55.810 --> 00:04:59.820
Come on. Your respects.

00:05:00.520 --> 00:05:04.590
Everything here is made
by the GarEden Corporation.

00:05:05.070 --> 00:05:06.300
GarEden?

00:05:07.360 --> 00:05:07.920
That.

00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:13.650
I see.

00:05:15.790 --> 00:05:20.920
Oh! Something popped up! This is amazing!

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:23.420
Isn't Sword sad?

00:05:23.420 --> 00:05:24.460
My respects.

00:05:24.760 --> 00:05:27.230
He called him partner...

00:05:28.390 --> 00:05:31.350
Sadness can be a method
of mourning for the dead.

00:05:32.220 --> 00:05:33.880
However, that isn't the case for us.

00:05:35.390 --> 00:05:37.580
See our duty to the end.

00:05:38.270 --> 00:05:40.750
That is our way of
honoring those who have fallen.

00:05:41.610 --> 00:05:42.900
What do you mean?

00:05:43.690 --> 00:05:45.910
Why did you come here?

00:05:47.820 --> 00:05:50.370
I came here to find my big brother.

00:05:50.370 --> 00:05:51.370
Is that all?

00:05:56.540 --> 00:06:01.590
My master, the King of
El Dorado, summons you.

00:06:03.130 --> 00:06:07.750
Hey! That place seriously 
looks delicious! That!

00:06:21.270 --> 00:06:22.350
They're here.

00:06:22.860 --> 00:06:23.390
Yeah.

00:06:24.020 --> 00:06:26.490
And not just one or two.

00:06:26.940 --> 00:06:28.300
What's here?

00:06:28.780 --> 00:06:29.660
Horrors.

00:06:30.240 --> 00:06:32.170
Horrors? Huh?!

00:06:33.410 --> 00:06:35.790
They probably didn't gather here naturally.

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:38.250
Like the Land of Guidance said.

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:42.080
King has the power to control Horrors.

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:46.760
It could be that this
entire city is ran by Horrors.

00:06:47.760 --> 00:06:50.270
It's weird that Bishop and
the others haven't made a move yet.

00:06:50.880 --> 00:06:53.640
King's motive must lie
in the true form of this city.

00:06:53.640 --> 00:06:54.220
Yeah.

00:06:54.850 --> 00:06:58.890
Yeah. I think we need to
find out more about King, too.

00:06:59.310 --> 00:07:02.600
I think that's what I should be doing now.

00:07:03.150 --> 00:07:07.570
I might find out more
about my brother that way.

00:07:11.570 --> 00:07:12.560
You'll meet him.

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:14.220
I'm sure.

00:07:14.990 --> 00:07:16.720
That's why we're here.

00:07:17.450 --> 00:07:20.710
Looks like your skills aren't
the only thing that's improved.

00:07:20.710 --> 00:07:21.460
Shut up.

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:28.130
We should ask around town first.

00:07:28.130 --> 00:07:28.840
Yeah.

00:07:30.260 --> 00:07:31.380
What about Luke?

00:07:31.380 --> 00:07:33.270
He's going to try a different method.

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:34.990
I see.

00:07:35.550 --> 00:07:38.850
I guess I should check 
out the internet, myself.

00:07:39.890 --> 00:07:40.450
Huh?

00:07:43.350 --> 00:07:44.040
What's wrong?

00:07:44.650 --> 00:07:46.830
No, it's just...

00:07:53.780 --> 00:07:54.950
I see.

00:07:56.580 --> 00:08:00.580
Oh, this city has its own networking system.

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:03.500
We have to use this ELDO NET to connect.

00:08:04.210 --> 00:08:07.570
Ooh? Why not give it a try?

00:08:08.590 --> 00:08:09.880
Then, I'll...

00:08:10.090 --> 00:08:12.090
Check out the network over there.

00:08:12.470 --> 00:08:16.430
--My respects.
--You're the worst!

00:08:16.430 --> 00:08:17.810
I'm depending on you!

00:08:18.810 --> 00:08:21.730
Hey, there, young ladies!

00:08:24.850 --> 00:08:26.740
Is this it?

00:08:27.980 --> 00:08:29.980
Connected to ELDO NET.

00:08:51.380 --> 00:08:52.300
That's cold!

00:08:54.800 --> 00:08:55.670
Huh?!

00:08:56.180 --> 00:09:01.650
Amazing! I can feel it!
I can smell things and feel the air!

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:07.190
Ouch!

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:14.700
It smells so good!

00:09:17.820 --> 00:09:21.160
It's delicious! Whoa! Even taste!

00:09:21.580 --> 00:09:23.030
Huh? Hey, you!

00:09:23.450 --> 00:09:24.810
Huh?

00:09:25.210 --> 00:09:26.580
Is this your first time in ELDO?

00:09:28.170 --> 00:09:29.540
Yeah, what's going on?

00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:32.960
It's all thanks to the "El Dorado System."

00:09:33.920 --> 00:09:35.910
It recreates all of your five senses!

00:09:36.300 --> 00:09:37.280
Wow!

00:09:38.050 --> 00:09:41.820
The beta testing is almost over
and the official service will start soon!

00:09:42.470 --> 00:09:45.230
Then, it'll be available to the whole world!

00:09:45.230 --> 00:09:46.350
The whole world?!

00:09:46.690 --> 00:09:47.730
Come here.

00:09:47.730 --> 00:09:49.430
I'll introduce you to my friends.

00:09:51.360 --> 00:09:56.360
W-W-Wait a sec!
There's something I need to ask first.

00:09:57.030 --> 00:10:00.280
Have any of your friends 
suddenly disappeared?

00:10:01.080 --> 00:10:03.810
Or have you heard of any
rumors of something like that?

00:10:08.870 --> 00:10:12.210
Hey, now! Why are you
bringing up such depressing things?!

00:10:12.210 --> 00:10:12.940
Huh?

00:10:13.380 --> 00:10:17.050
You'll make a ton of friends on ELDO.

00:10:17.050 --> 00:10:19.550
Who cares if one or two of them disappear!

00:10:20.340 --> 00:10:21.510
Huh?

00:10:23.390 --> 00:10:26.500
Even if one or two disappear, huh?

00:10:31.730 --> 00:10:35.300
Hey, you. Aren't you going to play with them?

00:10:36.490 --> 00:10:38.200
I don't really understand.

00:10:38.200 --> 00:10:41.310
Why are they all so happy?

00:10:41.910 --> 00:10:47.000
They aren't resisting.
They accept all new pleasures.

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:50.170
No matter what they lose in the end.

00:10:50.580 --> 00:10:52.880
That's how the city of El Dorado works.

00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:57.300
Why do you want to
know about missing people?

00:10:58.170 --> 00:10:59.680
That's...

00:11:01.470 --> 00:11:03.810
Do you know the Golden Knight?

00:11:06.560 --> 00:11:09.460
Huh? Um...

00:11:26.330 --> 00:11:27.290
These levels.

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:31.300
Horrors must gather here regularly.

00:11:33.170 --> 00:11:35.170
What are those markings?

00:11:35.170 --> 00:11:37.800
Places we believe Horrors are using.

00:11:38.380 --> 00:11:39.430
Using?

00:11:39.880 --> 00:11:42.630
Probably to gather and eat people.

00:11:44.390 --> 00:11:45.220
How about you two?

00:11:45.850 --> 00:11:47.470
Sophie found this.

00:11:49.350 --> 00:11:52.820
"If you want to know the truth
of this town, come to meet me."

00:11:54.520 --> 00:11:58.210
We have no choice. Even if it's a trap.

00:12:00.780 --> 00:12:01.860
This is the place...

00:12:11.660 --> 00:12:14.630
Looks like that's our guide.

00:12:35.900 --> 00:12:38.730
Were you the one who called for me?

00:12:40.650 --> 00:12:47.020
I've been waiting a long
time for you, Golden Knight.

00:12:59.800 --> 00:13:01.880
An employee of GarEden Corporation?

00:13:01.880 --> 00:13:03.420
A former employee.

00:13:04.220 --> 00:13:08.860
Why did you call us here?
And using such a roundabout method.

00:13:09.350 --> 00:13:13.430
So I wouldn't be found by those monsters.

00:13:13.810 --> 00:13:15.980
You know of Horrors?

00:13:20.110 --> 00:13:21.400
What is this?

00:13:21.400 --> 00:13:23.600
A video of one of the
places known as a "cafeteria."

00:13:24.110 --> 00:13:24.950
Cafeteria?

00:13:25.400 --> 00:13:28.360
This city is controlled by monsters.

00:13:28.740 --> 00:13:30.610
Though the people don't know.

00:13:31.490 --> 00:13:34.030
The one controlling it all
is the GarEden Corporation.

00:13:34.410 --> 00:13:35.500
What?

00:13:35.830 --> 00:13:39.580
Communication. Industry. Politics.

00:13:40.670 --> 00:13:44.470
The GarEden Corporation
manages all of that in this city.

00:13:44.920 --> 00:13:46.310
And their goal...

00:13:46.840 --> 00:13:48.680
A feeding grounds for Horrors...

00:13:49.350 --> 00:13:54.550
The mayor. The chief of police.
Everyone of power is a monster.

00:13:56.020 --> 00:13:56.650
Shit!

00:13:57.350 --> 00:13:59.260
What a utopia.

00:14:00.060 --> 00:14:01.800
How did you find out about this?

00:14:02.900 --> 00:14:05.230
It started with a bit of curiosity.

00:14:05.900 --> 00:14:10.120
I found a data server that was
under some really heavy protection.

00:14:10.990 --> 00:14:15.000
I hacked my way in and
quietly took a look late one night.

00:14:16.750 --> 00:14:17.540
That's where...

00:14:20.080 --> 00:14:23.250
That's where you found this.

00:14:23.250 --> 00:14:26.190
No, this wasn't the only thing I found.

00:14:27.170 --> 00:14:28.250
What do you mean?

00:14:30.430 --> 00:14:32.070
A message came.

00:14:40.310 --> 00:14:43.700
The truth of El Dorado
was written in the e-mail.

00:14:46.740 --> 00:14:53.350
It told me to hurry and hide
because the company already knew.

00:14:54.240 --> 00:14:56.970
I've been hiding here since then.

00:14:58.750 --> 00:15:00.760
Did you find out about 
us through that e-mail?

00:15:01.210 --> 00:15:05.650
Yeah, that a Golden Knight that
eliminates these monsters existed.

00:15:06.170 --> 00:15:09.540
He knew about Makai Knights?
Who was that guy?

00:15:10.050 --> 00:15:14.390
The message said it was
from a person named Sword.

00:15:14.720 --> 00:15:15.380
Huh?

00:15:17.470 --> 00:15:19.550
No way! Wasn't from me!

00:15:20.060 --> 00:15:20.970
You're sure about that?

00:15:21.480 --> 00:15:22.070
Yeah.

00:15:22.520 --> 00:15:24.740
So someone who knows Sword?

00:15:28.440 --> 00:15:31.300
"Do not allow the true
El Dorado to reach completion."

00:15:31.860 --> 00:15:33.740
That was the last thing it said.

00:15:34.830 --> 00:15:38.130
I found that keyword
in the data I found as well.

00:15:41.870 --> 00:15:46.740
A secret organization was formed
around a certain genius programmer.

00:15:47.340 --> 00:15:48.850
What will happen if it reaches completion?

00:15:49.300 --> 00:15:50.920
There were no details,

00:15:51.550 --> 00:15:55.620
but it was said to lead
people to eternal happiness.

00:15:57.430 --> 00:15:59.650
Eternal happiness...

00:16:02.440 --> 00:16:03.690
Wh-What is it?!

00:16:04.150 --> 00:16:05.400
This place has been found out.

00:16:05.810 --> 00:16:06.770
No way...

00:16:07.110 --> 00:16:10.040
I'll take them on.
Take care of Sophie and this guy.

00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:31.550
Hey. Sorry, but we're about to close.

00:16:31.970 --> 00:16:34.300
Please do your shopping elsewhere.

00:16:42.600 --> 00:16:44.850
Looks like they're not
planning on letting us escape.

00:16:45.900 --> 00:16:47.900
We're changing locations once they're gone.

00:16:47.900 --> 00:16:50.730
There's a drain that leads 
outside underground.

00:16:50.730 --> 00:16:52.530
If we can get that far...

00:16:56.700 --> 00:17:01.660
I'm so pathetic.
I'm so scared I can't handle it.

00:17:02.200 --> 00:17:10.380
I'm a coward. Until now,
I just hid once I found out the truth.

00:17:10.840 --> 00:17:11.880
That's not true.

00:17:13.510 --> 00:17:14.570
That's not true!

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:18.340
You waited for us, didn't you?

00:17:18.720 --> 00:17:20.350
While holding all that fear in...

00:17:27.650 --> 00:17:31.190
There should still be 
something that I can do.

00:17:32.190 --> 00:17:33.750
Give me your phone.

00:17:34.530 --> 00:17:35.040
Okay.

00:17:38.870 --> 00:17:42.660
I'm giving you this data,
just in case something happens to me.

00:17:43.250 --> 00:17:47.760
The data I found at the GarEden
Corporation and even that message.

00:18:04.890 --> 00:18:05.930
Hurry.

00:18:14.110 --> 00:18:16.590
Dammit. Where are they hiding?

00:18:42.050 --> 00:18:43.630
Wh-Who is it?

00:18:45.600 --> 00:18:48.600
Do you want to tell me something?

00:18:55.070 --> 00:18:55.990
Are you all right?

00:18:56.900 --> 00:18:58.150
What happened?

00:19:05.830 --> 00:19:08.580
Luke! At two and ten o'clock!

00:19:10.790 --> 00:19:11.380
Got them.

00:19:12.920 --> 00:19:15.000
Third floor, one o'clock.
Second floor, eleven o'clock.

00:19:19.590 --> 00:19:20.430
What is this?

00:19:24.220 --> 00:19:25.060
Good job!

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:09.600
You don't have to pay me back, okay?

00:20:10.520 --> 00:20:11.780
I'll definitely return the favor!

00:20:17.070 --> 00:20:18.450
Looks like it's over.

00:20:18.860 --> 00:20:19.590
Yeah.

00:20:23.280 --> 00:20:24.210
What's this?

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:31.010
Brother!

00:20:31.500 --> 00:20:32.620
What's wrong?

00:20:33.170 --> 00:20:36.090
This person is my big brother!

00:20:36.710 --> 00:20:40.610
I see. You're the
little sister of Martin Hennes.

00:20:41.010 --> 00:20:41.970
You know him?

00:20:42.420 --> 00:20:46.890
He's the programmer involved
with the true El Dorado.

00:20:48.390 --> 00:20:49.470
My brother...?

00:20:54.020 --> 00:20:55.840
A dock for workers.

00:20:56.810 --> 00:20:58.790
I should be able to leave the city with this.

00:20:59.530 --> 00:21:05.030
There's a motorcycle parked
on 12th, west of the slums. Use it.

00:21:05.990 --> 00:21:07.570
A barrier is cast on it.

00:21:08.330 --> 00:21:09.970
The roads should be safe
for you if you're on it.

00:21:10.450 --> 00:21:11.180
Thank you.

00:21:11.910 --> 00:21:15.980
In Russell City, go to the
Fei Long's restaurant in Chinatown.

00:21:16.500 --> 00:21:19.040
The poster girl is a little wild,

00:21:19.460 --> 00:21:22.590
but the fried rice, gyoza,
and dandan noodles are all delicious.

00:21:23.130 --> 00:21:24.640
Thanks for everything.

00:21:30.720 --> 00:21:35.250
I only spoke to him once, 
so I don't know much.

00:21:36.230 --> 00:21:39.800
But he told me he was proud
to have you as a little sister.

00:21:49.070 --> 00:21:53.200
I heard. Looks like you really helped us out.

00:21:53.200 --> 00:21:55.630
Hey! Stop that!

00:21:57.420 --> 00:21:59.260
How did you know where the Horrors were?

00:21:59.960 --> 00:22:03.400
Well, a girl told me.

00:22:04.470 --> 00:22:05.540
A girl?

00:22:06.050 --> 00:22:06.570
Yeah.

00:22:07.590 --> 00:22:10.970
Was that the person
who sent that message as Sword?

00:22:15.180 --> 00:22:16.760
What's going on?
